# ⛔ PRE-LAUNCH: server-level noindex for EVERY response.
#
# ⚠️  THIS FILE DOES NOTHING ON VERCEL, which is where the site deploys.
#     `_headers` is a Cloudflare Pages format; Vercel ignores it entirely.
#     The header that actually runs is the X-Robots-Tag rule in vercel.json.
#     This file is kept only so a move back to Cloudflare Pages stays covered.
#
# At go-live, DELETE this file — and remove the X-Robots-Tag from vercel.json.
# Both steps, plus robots.txt and siteConfig.allowIndexing, are in GO-LIVE.md.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet
